{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10376","headline":"同羣公题中山寺 · 高适","name":"同羣公题中山寺","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"平原十里外，稍稍云岩深。\n遂及清净所，都无人世心。\n名僧既礼谒，高阁复登临。\n石壁倚松径，山田多栗林。\n超遥尽巘崿，逼侧仍岖嶔。\n吾欲休世事，於焉聊自任。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"高适","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_10376.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_10376","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}